    <briefdescription>
<para>A single streamed transcription token emitted during streaming transcription. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each token represents one word or segment produced during incremental inference. The callback registered with transcribeStream() is invoked once per token. </para>
